## Setting up the recurrence

**Particular solution:** Setting $a_n = A$ (constant): $A = -3A - 4A + 2008 \Rightarrow 8A = 2008 \Rightarrow A = 251$.

Let $c_n = a_n - 251$, so $c_{n+2} = -3c_n - 4c_{n-1}$ with:
