## Key simplification via $d_n = c_n + c_{n-1}$

Define $d_n = c_n + c_{n-1} = a_n + a_{n-1} - 502$. Since $d_n = r^{n-1}(r+1)$ for mode $r$, the root $r=-1$ is killed (gives 0). So $d_n$ satisfies:
$$d_{n+2} = d_{n+1} - 4d_n, \quad d_1 = -501,\ d_2 = 1503$$

**Simplifying $b_n$:** Note $a_{n+2} - a_n = c_{n+2} - c_n = -4(c_n + c_{n-1}) = -4d_n$ and $502 - a_{n-1} - a_{n-2} = -d_{n-1}$. So:
$$b_n = 5(-4d_n)(-d_{n-1}) + 4^n \cdot 2004 \cdot 501 = 20\,d_n\,d_{n-1} + 4^n \cdot 2004 \cdot 501$$

## Scaling out 501

Since $d_1 = -501$, $d_2 = 3 \cdot 501$, set $d_n = 501\,e_n$ with $e_1=-1, e_2=3$, $e_{n+2}=e_{n+1}-4e_n$. Also $2004 = 4\cdot 501$, so:
